n#5. Equity / mezzanine plug extension":[40,43],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#5. Equity / mezzanine plug extension#{1}":[42,43],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#6. Restricted Cash double-rollforward fix":[44,47],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#6. Restricted Cash double-rollforward fix#{1}":[46,47],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#7. Dynamic FORECAST_LABELS in model-write":[48,51],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#7. Dynamic FORECAST_LABELS in model-write#{1}":[50,51],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#8. Annual→QTR row mirror in model-write":[52,55],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#8. Annual→QTR row mirror in model-write#{1}":[54,55],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#9. Forecast cell formatting carried from historicals":[56,59],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#9. Forecast cell formatting carried from historicals#{1}":[58,59],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#10. Workbook cleanup":[60,63],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#10. Workbook cleanup#{1}":[62,63],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#11. Folder layout reorg (post-session)":[64,73],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Work done this session#11. Folder layout reorg (post-session)#{1}":[66,73],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Current state":[74,83],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Current state#{1}":[76,83],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Open decisions / pending work":[84,92],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Open decisions / pending work#{1}":[86,92],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Key file paths":[93,111],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#Key file paths#{1}":[95,111],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#How to create the next handoff":[112,141],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#How to create the next handoff#{1}":[114,115],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#How to create the next handoff#Required steps":[116,121],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#How to create the next handoff#Required steps#{1}":[118,121],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#How to create the next handoff#Structure":[122,133],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#How to create the next handoff#Structure#{1}":[124,133],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#How to create the next handoff#Consolidation rules":[134,141],"#April 28th — BS Closure Session#How to create the next handoff#Consolidation rules#{1}":[136,141]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"session-handoff","date":"2026-04-28","topic":"Made the forecast balance sheet balance to $0 across all 3 tickers (PEP/PG/CELH) by implementing Path B closure — BS-driven CF where every BS row's delta is absorbed by a CF entry. Diagnosed root causes (BS+CF forecast independently → identity drift), introduced RESIDUAL_PLUG, library-declared cf_delta_target, APIC/AOCI rollforwards capturing SBC + FX equity offsets, ZERO defaults for non-anchor CF rows, dynamic FORECAST_LABELS, annual→QTR row mirror in model-write, forecast cell formatting carried from historicals. Cleaned up stale workbooks; one canonical xlsx per ticker.","tags":["#session","#bs-closure","#path-b","#residual-plug","#cf-delta-target","#forecast-formatting"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"Sessions/CELH Model/Handoffs/Archive/April 28th BS Closure Session.md"},
